{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to join our Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update Log(20260127):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re working on the 15th Boss right now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Steam demo is available for play \u2014come give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a small team of three, Cat Gladiator was born from our love for the Monster Hunter series. We set out to create a 2D co-op action game\u2014while simplifying weapon controls appropriately to achieve that &quot;easy to pick up, hard to master&quot; feel. We\u2019ve also enhanced item usage and more, all to let more people jump into the fun of co-op hunting games with ease!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you play as a hunter cat who gets laid off and becomes a gladiator to make ends meet. Grab your weapons and team up with fellow cats to battle colossal bosses in the arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/0d7b2fd48c02a646a1dd37e8d05829ca.webp?t=1773912393\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/388762a1f125d20cad18dc42a764e308.poster.avif?t=1773912393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/388762a1f125d20cad18dc42a764e308.webm?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/388762a1f125d20cad18dc42a764e308.mp4?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggling alone? Team up with up to 3 friends for 4-player online co-op! Enjoy the thrill of dominating your foes together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/ecf8c073be43e9a6f072ff5ae15446a7.webp?t=1773912393\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/301d375c4c78e9db99af09b457f61830.poster.avif?t=1773912393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/301d375c4c78e9db99af09b457f61830.webm?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/301d375c4c78e9db99af09b457f61830.mp4?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena foes demand respect! Observe their attack patterns, exploit your weapon's unique traits, and strategically counter. Equipment bonuses and tactical item usage are key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/b517c71204136f75a624564d1727ac41.webp?t=1773912393\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/226036ad87526fcd5c373f86b8d6c2f0.poster.avif?t=1773912393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/226036ad87526fcd5c373f86b8d6c2f0.webm?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/226036ad87526fcd5c373f86b8d6c2f0.mp4?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six distinct weapons available:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword &amp; Shield: Balanced offense/defense with guard capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longsword: Graceful evasions (Foresight Slash) and lethal counterattacks (Iaiai Slash).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun: Cycle between sustained DPS and charged attacks, with dodge-triggered rapid shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greatsword: Deliver devastating charged strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual Blades: Unleash whirlwind combos with agile dashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harp: Ranged musical attacks that buff allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon offers unique combat rhythms and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/e244f62d038b0f279f33277cfb007fa5.webp?t=1773912393\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/699d96a0b8e247371d8e01d6afc5c898.poster.avif?t=1773912393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/699d96a0b8e247371d8e01d6afc5c898.webm?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/699d96a0b8e247371d8e01d6afc5c898.mp4?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from challenges and go fishing to relax. Different fish grant different stat boosts\u2014don\u2019t forget to eat fish before battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/2982e55b75ffdbe989e946f4af71224f.webp?t=1773912393\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/832c49430beee130ae010646e3f1de56.poster.avif?t=1773912393\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/832c49430beee130ae010646e3f1de56.webm?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/832c49430beee130ae010646e3f1de56.mp4?t=1773912393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, explosive barrels, healing potions, basketball bombs, secret grilled fish buffs \u2013 master items to tip battles in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/68f7dc6edf5f35e98bf83eecea29a6cc.webp?t=1773912393\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/extras/595cb61bb62194a0cd99fa80e7e4e1a0.avif?t=1773912393\" width=1048 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge armor from boss materials to boost stats (attack/defense/crit) or enhance item efficiency (CD/casting speed). Experiment with synergistic builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347200?t=1773912393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773912393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347200/2ebfc4ea4bdcbf8600c9a85bf8c40955b5dd4812/capsule_